UiHmiV710 Repository License Notice

This repository does not currently publish a single repository-wide
open-source license that applies to all files.

The source tree contains mixed-origin material, including files with
third-party or vendor copyright notices. The build can also link against
vendor-provided libraries such as `cc-aux2`.

Because of that, this `LICENSE` file must not be interpreted as a blanket
license grant for every file in the repository.

For the current licensing and redistribution notes, see:

- `docs/LICENSES.md`
- `docs/LEGAL.md`
- `licenses/LGPL-2.1.txt`

Practical guidance:

- Treat `CCAux/` and `cc-aux2` as third-party/vendor materials unless exact
  upstream provenance is confirmed.
- If you distribute a build that includes an LGPL-covered `cc-aux2` library,
  include the LGPL text from `licenses/LGPL-2.1.txt` and follow the release
  checklist in `docs/LEGAL.md`.
- Do not assume that the entire repository is LGPL only because one shipped
  dependency may be LGPL-covered.

If the repository is later relicensed or full provenance is confirmed for all
mixed-origin files, this notice can be replaced with a conventional root
license text.
